      "id": "msg_0389_R35R0201_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "The Bug-Catching Contest is held on\n",
        "Tuesday, Thursday, and Saturday.\r",
        "Not only do you earn a prize just\n",
        "for participating, you also get to\f",
        "keep the Bug-type Pokémon you catch."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0389_R35R0201_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Sorry to tell you this, but the\n",
        "Pokéathlon Dome is still under\f",
        "construction, and the entrance there\f",
        "is off-limits.\r",
        "You know what a rush construction is?\r",
        "In short, they are working really hard.\n",
        "It shouldn’t take too long.\r",
        "Just a little more patience, OK?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0389_R35R0201_00003",
      "from": "scr_seq_R35R0201_002#0"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0389_R35R0201_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Arrgh!\r",
        "When is the Pokéathlon going to\n",
        "be ready?\r",
        "I can’t just sit here and wait!\n",
        "I’ll go on an around-Johto run!"
